identifier: KKBlocks
name: KKBlocks
abstract: Static building blocks for Kerbal Konstructs in six shapes and twelve colours.
description: |-
  KKBlocks adds 42 static meshes for Kerbal Konstructs: cubes, ramps,
  pyramids, cylinders, domes and spheres in seven sizes each. Every static
  offers twelve colour variants through the stock TextureSet system, giving
  504 combinations for scenery, bases and launch-site decoration.

  All meshes share one stock-like KSP/Diffuse material, keep the original
  cube mesh names and save-compatible dimensions, and need no plugin.
  Ramps and the other angular shapes use solid mesh colliders so they can be
  driven on; spheres use a sphere collider. The models are generated offline
  with the included MuTool source, so there is no runtime mesh generation.
author: Lynx
$kref: '#/ckan/github/ehemaliger56-debug/KKBlocks'
ksp_version: 1.12
license: restricted
tags:
  - parts
  - graphics
  - config
depends:
  - name: KerbalKonstructs
